abstract: "Research code and reproduction instructions for driver-aware operational stress modelling and persistence-anchored battery-capacity forecasting, with a dual-stream patch Transformer, named concepts, spline KAN and matched MLP controls. Dataset-specific targets and incomplete validation are documented."
keywords:
  - electric vehicles
